# Web visualizer — committed archive snapshots, SNARK public inputs, and
# devnet deploy info. (`*.json` is ignored globally above; whitelist these
# so the static site has data to read.)
!web/public/archives/**/*.json
!web/public/snark/*.json
!web/public/deploy.json

.claude/
